1. Added individual imports for all Command subcomponents that were being used (CommandInput, CommandList, etc.)
2. Wrapped the Command component in a div with padding to ensure proper display
3. Used the imported subcomponents explicitly instead of accessing them through Command.Input, Command.List, etc.
4. Maintained all the existing functionality while ensuring proper component resolution

This should resolve the "invalid element type" error by ensuring all components are properly imported and available at render time.

